                                                "sense_id": "54933825-c7ce-3bfa-8bdb-e92479094f12",
                                                "text": "I saw a breath of wind emerge from the furthest horizon, bowing over the heads of corn in distant fields, pouring like a flood over all that vast expanse, and finally come to rest, warm and rustling, among the clover and sainfoin at my feet […]"
